   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "RELAY HIRES, example 6 of 8: example 2 with the H3 Fast Tail Sampler for pass 1.\n\nPass 1 runs the H3 Fast Tail Sampler instead of KSamplerSelect euler: the 12 euler steps where H3 decides the take (sigma >= 0.79) exactly as before, then 4 2nd-order steps for the smooth tail instead of 8. Pass 1 is ~20% faster with the same take, detail and soundtrack (the audio comes out ~0.5 dB louder, closer to a fully converged finish). De-rope, FaceDetail and the relay keep their own samplers. Keep BasicScheduler beta57 20.\n\nH3 smears very fast motion (a kick, a sword clash). The motion gate finds sustained fast motion in pass 1; only that burst is slowed down, redrawn as drawings on 2s (pass 2: turbo, window attention) and spliced back, so the smeared frames come back as clean drawings before the relay. Calm clips skip pass 2. Then H3 Relay Hires to 1920 as in example 5.\n\nSet the pass-1 size, hires scale and prompt in the blue SETTINGS group. Needs: ComfyUI-H3-FastDerope, ComfyUI-H3-RelayHires, ComfyUI-MAINodes, ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite, comfyui_essentials. Models: MiniMax H3 (int8 DiT, text encoder, fp16 + int8 video VAEs, audio VAE), taeh3, the DMAD 4-step turbo LoRA.\n\nTested: 134 s end to end on an RTX 5090 (5 s clip, 124 frames)."
   ]
  }
